{
  "_comment": [
    "The third-party libraries the controls load, in one place.",
    "",
    "This file is the single source of truth for BOTH builds (see tools/vendor.mjs):",
    "the default build turns it into CDN URLs, the --local build vendors the files",
    "into app/webapp/lib/ and turns it into BSP paths. Neither set of URLs is",
    "written by hand, so the version a system downloads and the version this",
    "repository was tested against can never drift apart.",
    "",
    "'package' and 'file' point into node_modules, so the version comes from",
    "package.json / package-lock.json and {version} in 'cdn' is substituted from",
    "the installed package. Pinning a new version is a change to package.json plus",
    "'npm run vendor' - never an edited URL.",
    "",
    "'target' is the file name inside app/webapp/lib/. BSP page names allow only",
    "letters, digits, '_' and '.' (tools/app2bsp.mjs), so a package's hyphens are",
    "replaced here and names like 'index.umd.js' are made unique."
  ],

  "libDir": "lib",
  "resourceRoot": "z2ui5_cci",

  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "chartJs",
      "package": "chart.js",
      "file": "dist/chart.umd.js",
      "target": "chart.umd.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@{version}/dist/chart.umd.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "chartJsDatalabels",
      "package": "chartjs-plugin-datalabels",
      "file": "dist/chartjs-plugin-datalabels.js",
      "target": "chartjs_plugin_datalabels.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-plugin-datalabels@{version}/dist/chartjs-plugin-datalabels.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "chartJsAutocolors",
      "package": "chartjs-plugin-autocolors",
      "file": "dist/chartjs-plugin-autocolors.min.js",
      "target": "chartjs_plugin_autocolors.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-plugin-autocolors@{version}/dist/chartjs-plugin-autocolors.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "chartJsDeferred",
      "package": "chartjs-plugin-deferred",
      "file": "dist/chartjs-plugin-deferred.min.js",
      "target": "chartjs_plugin_deferred.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-plugin-deferred@{version}/dist/chartjs-plugin-deferred.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "chartJsAnnotation",
      "package": "chartjs-plugin-annotation",
      "file": "dist/chartjs-plugin-annotation.min.js",
      "target": "chartjs_plugin_annotation.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-plugin-annotation@{version}/dist/chartjs-plugin-annotation.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "chartJsVenn",
      "package": "chartjs-chart-venn",
      "file": "build/index.umd.min.js",
      "target": "chartjs_chart_venn.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-chart-venn@{version}/build/index.umd.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "chartJsWordcloud",
      "package": "chartjs-chart-wordcloud",
      "file": "build/index.umd.min.js",
      "target": "chartjs_chart_wordcloud.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-chart-wordcloud@{version}/build/index.umd.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "bwipJs",
      "package": "bwip-js",
      "file": "dist/bwip-js-min.js",
      "target": "bwip_js.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bwip-js@{version}/dist/bwip-js-min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "driverJs",
      "package": "driver.js",
      "file": "dist/driver.js.iife.js",
      "target": "driver.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/driver.js@{version}/dist/driver.js.iife.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "driverJsCss",
      "package": "driver.js",
      "file": "dist/driver.css",
      "target": "driver.css",
      "kind": "css",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/driver.js@{version}/dist/driver.css"
    },
    {
      "key": "animateCss",
      "package": "animate.css",
      "file": "animate.min.css",
      "target": "animate.css",
      "kind": "css",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/animate.css@{version}/animate.min.css"
    },
    {
      "key": "marked",
      "package": "marked",
      "file": "marked.min.js",
      "target": "marked.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked@{version}/marked.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "domPurify",
      "package": "dompurify",
      "file": "dist/purify.min.js",
      "target": "purify.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dompurify@{version}/dist/purify.min.js"
    },
    {
      "key": "fontAwesomeCss",
      "package": "@fortawesome/fontawesome-free",
      "file": "css/all.min.css",
      "target": "fontawesome.css",
      "kind": "css",
      "generator": "fontawesome",
      "cdn": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@{version}/css/all.min.css"
    }
  ],

  "fontAwesome": {
    "_comment": [
      "The IconPool half of the FontAwesome control needs a DIRECTORY holding",
      "<family>.woff2 and the metadata JSON that maps icon names to code points -",
      "the npm package ships the fonts but not that JSON, hence the prepared",
      "bundle below. A BSP page is a text object, so neither the fonts nor that",
      "directory can be vendored here: in the local build 'fontUri' is empty and",
      "the IconPool registration is off. The CSS class names work either way -",
      "the local stylesheet carries the webfonts inline as data URIs.",
      "",
      "'families' lists the @font-face families kept in the local stylesheet. The",
      "package also declares 'Font Awesome 5 *' and 'FontAwesome' aliases for v4/v5",
      "class names; each one would repeat its whole base64 font, so they are",
      "dropped and only the v6 families survive."
    ],
    "cdnFontUri": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/choper725/resources/dist/",
    "families": ["Font Awesome 6 Free", "Font Awesome 6 Brands"]
  }
}
